*>--- conformance-case
*> id: pb5598-active-class-property-refused
*> rules: [2002-SR-8.4.2.9.2-5, 2002-GR-8.4.2.9.3-1, 2002-SR-11.6.2-6, 2002-GR-11.6.3-6,
*>     2002-GR-13.16.40.3-1]
*> source-format: free
*> portable: unverified
*>---
*> kb/Work PB5598 - the ACTIVE-CLASS bans on a GET/SET property
*> method's returning/USING item (2023 11.7.3 SR6/SR7), on the
*> PROPERTY clause (2023 13.18.42.3 SR6) and on an inline method
*> invocation's returning item (2023 8.4.3.4.3 SR4) are 2014
*> additions. 2002 11.6.2 SR6 asks only the USING/RETURNING shape,
*> 13.16.58.2 SR15 admits ACTIVE-CLASS in an instance definition and
*> a method's linkage, 13.16.40.2 SR1 puts no class limit on PROPERTY
*> and 8.4.2.4.2 SR4 bans only ANY LENGTH on an inline invocation's
*> returning item. The same program as pb5598-active-class-property-2002, which is
*> legal at 2002; at 2014 and 2023 the first ban reached is
*> COBOL2790 (11.7.3 SR6). INIT stores
*> SELF in both properties: ME (clause), SELFREF (GET method) and
*> the inline GETME all yield the object itself, three "SAME".
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PB5598RM.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
REPOSITORY.
    CLASS PB5598RC
    PROPERTY ME
    PROPERTY SELFREF.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE PB5598RC.
01 B USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE PB5598RC.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    INVOKE PB5598RC "NEW" RETURNING A.
    INVOKE A "INIT".
    SET B TO ME OF A.
    IF B = A DISPLAY "SAME" ELSE DISPLAY "DIFFERENT" END-IF.
    SET B TO SELFREF OF A.
    IF B = A DISPLAY "SAME" ELSE DISPLAY "DIFFERENT" END-IF.
    SET B TO A :: "GETME".
    IF B = A DISPLAY "SAME" ELSE DISPLAY "DIFFERENT" END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM PB5598RM.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
CLASS-ID. PB5598RC INHERITS FROM BASE.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
REPOSITORY.
    CLASS BASE.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
OBJECT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ME USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE ACTIVE-CLASS
      PROPERTY WITH NO SET.
01 W-R USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE ACTIVE-CLASS.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
METHOD-ID. INIT.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    SET ME TO SELF.
    SET W-R TO SELF.
END METHOD.
METHOD-ID. GET PROPERTY SELFREF.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-R USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE ACTIVE-CLASS.
PROCEDURE DIVISION RETURNING LK-R.
MAIN.
    SET LK-R TO W-R.
END METHOD.
METHOD-ID. SET PROPERTY SELFREF.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-V USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE ACTIVE-CLASS.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-V.
MAIN.
    SET W-R TO LK-V.
END METHOD.
METHOD-ID. GETME.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-ME USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE ACTIVE-CLASS.
PROCEDURE DIVISION RETURNING LK-ME.
MAIN.
    SET LK-ME TO SELF.
END METHOD.
END OBJECT.
END CLASS PB5598RC.
